NTE27 · Expression of interest received

Thank you for expressing interest.

We have received your interest in partnering with or sponsoring the National Transition Event.

{!IF(ISBLANK(Lead.FirstName),"Hello,","Hi ")}{!Lead.FirstName}{!IF(ISBLANK(Lead.FirstName),"",",")}

Thank you for telling us how {!Lead.Company} would like to be involved with NTE27. A member of the Mission Community team will review your interests and contact you to explore the most suitable opportunities.

What happens next

This acknowledgement confirms receipt of your expression of interest. It is not a commercial agreement or confirmation of a package.

Your expression of interest

